  "description": "Official xAI Grok Inference API (OpenAI-compat Chat Completions + Imagine image generation) on the v2 agent model contract (INPUT llm_input → OUTPUT llm_output). operation selects chat (POST /v1/chat/completions) or image_gen (POST /v1/images/generations). Auth is StudioQuack secret api_key sent as Authorization Bearer. Image payloads use type file (platform ref-id). Docs: https://docs.x.ai/developers/quickstart. Terms: https://x.ai/legal/terms-of-service-enterprise. Never log api_key.",
  "icon": "psychology",
  "tags": [
    "xai",
    "grok",
    "ai"
  ],
